          ]
        }
      ],
      "comment": "A {@SelectorParser} that only returns identifiers from its source where the client has read access on. To determine the credentials, a {@link CredentialsStorage} is used. To prevent dependency loop issues when constructing classes, this class is also a {@link ParamSetter} for its {@link PermissionReader} parameter.  This removing of identifiers is only done if the {@link DerivationConfig} contains the `derived:ReadableSources` feature.",
